"App settings and terminology are saved in UserDefaults. Optional text history is stored separately in the app's local container, excluded from automatic backup. Exports go only to the location you choose; synced folders may sync them." = "应用设置及术语保存在 UserDefaults。可选文字历史单独保存在 App 的本地容器中，并排除自动备份。导出仅写入你选择的位置；同步文件夹可能同步这些文件。";
"No screen images are captured." = "不捕获屏幕画面。";

/* Automatic on-device history summaries. */
"Summary queued. It will run when live captions are stopped." = "总结已排队，将在实时字幕停止后生成。";
"Creating a title and bilingual summary on this Mac…" = "正在此 Mac 上生成标题和双语总结…";
"AI-generated summary. Check important details against the full transcript." = "此总结由 AI 生成，请对照完整记录核实重要细节。";
"This Mac does not support the local Apple Intelligence model. Your full history is available." = "此 Mac 不支持本地 Apple 智能模型，您仍可查看完整历史记录。";
"Enable Apple Intelligence in System Settings to create local summaries. Your full history is available." = "请在系统设置中开启 Apple 智能，以生成本地总结。您仍可查看完整历史记录。";
"Apple’s local model is not ready. Summaries will retry when it becomes available." = "Apple 的本地模型尚未就绪，可用后将重试生成总结。";
"Apple’s local model does not support this session’s languages. Your full history is available." = "Apple 的本地模型不支持此记录的语言，您仍可查看完整历史记录。";
"A summary could not be created. It will retry after the next app launch. Your full history is available." = "暂时无法生成总结，将在下次启动应用后重试。您仍可查看完整历史记录。";
"There is not enough meaningful text to summarize. Your full history is available." = "可总结的有效文字不足，您仍可查看完整历史记录。";
"AI summary" = "AI 内容总结";
"Full transcript" = "完整对话记录";
"Some entries are incomplete. The summary uses only available text." = "部分条目不完整，总结仅依据已保存的文字。";
"A bilingual AI summary is not available yet. The full transcript follows." = "双语 AI 总结尚不可用，以下为完整对话记录。";
"When history is enabled, titles and bilingual summaries are created automatically on this Mac after captions stop, when Apple Intelligence is available." = "开启历史后，若 Apple 智能可用，实时字幕停止时会自动在此 Mac 上生成标题和双语总结。";
"Confirm that everyone involved knows and agrees to local text recording, AI summaries and export. Only new stable sentences will be saved. Audio is never saved." = "请确认所有参与者已知晓并同意本地文字记录、AI 总结及导出。仅保存开启后的新稳定句子，绝不保存音频。";

"The AI summary did not match the selected languages and was not displayed. It will retry after the next app launch. Your full history is available." = "AI 总结未符合所选语言，已暂停展示。下次启动应用后将重试，您仍可查看完整历史记录。";

"Concise" = "简洁";
"Detailed" = "详细";
"Main topic and core conclusions, in a short summary." = "简要总结主要话题和核心结论。";
"Overview, key points, reasons, decisions and open questions." = "包含概述、主要要点、原因、决定和尚未解决的问题。";
