/* Summary source and local processing. */
"Summaries are generated on this Mac using Apple Intelligence. Bilingual content is processed locally. Check important details against the full transcript." = "总结使用 Apple 智能在本机生成，双语内容均在本机处理。重要细节请对照完整记录核实。";

"Before enabling history, make sure everyone involved knows and agrees." = "开启前，请确保所有参与者已知晓并同意。";
"Learn about history and privacy" = "了解历史记录与隐私";
"History is saved on this Mac. Exports go only to the location you choose." = "历史记录保存在这台 Mac 上，导出文件仅保存到您选择的位置。";
"Generated with Apple Intelligence · On-device" = "由 Apple 智能生成 · 本机处理";
"About AI summaries" = "关于 AI 总结";

"Contextual enhancement" = "上下文增强";
"Contextual enhancement requires macOS 26.4 or later. System translation will be used." = "上下文增强需要 macOS 26.4 或更高版本，将使用系统翻译。";
"This Mac cannot run contextual enhancement. System translation will be used." = "此 Mac 无法运行上下文增强，将使用系统翻译。";
"Enable Apple Intelligence in System Settings for contextual enhancement. System translation will be used." = "请在系统设置中开启 Apple 智能以使用上下文增强，当前将使用系统翻译。";
"Apple’s local model is not ready for contextual enhancement. System translation will be used." = "Apple 本地模型尚未准备好用于上下文增强，将使用系统翻译。";
"Apple’s local model does not support this language pair for contextual enhancement. System translation will be used." = "Apple 本地模型不支持此语言组合的上下文增强，将使用系统翻译。";
"Contextual enhancement · On-device" = "上下文增强 · 本机处理";
"Contextual enhancement paused for this session; using system translation." = "本次字幕已暂停上下文增强，正在使用系统翻译。";
"Using system translation for this sentence." = "当前句正在使用系统翻译。";
"Contextual enhancement uses Apple Intelligence on this Mac to translate each sentence with up to four recent source sentences. It may be slower; system translation is used if it is unavailable, times out, or falls behind." = "上下文增强使用这台 Mac 上的 Apple 智能，参考最近最多四句原文翻译当前句。速度可能较慢；模型不可用、超时或跟不上时会使用系统翻译。";
"Context is held only in bounded memory and cleared when captions stop. It does not enable history or save audio. Only the final translation is displayed, read aloud, and saved when history is enabled." = "上下文仅在有限的内存空间中暂存，停止字幕后清除。不会因此开启历史或保存音频。只显示、朗读最终译文，并仅在历史开启后保存。";
"Contextual enhancement unavailable; using system translation." = "上下文增强不可用，正在使用系统翻译。";

